Hi {{recipientName}},

Confirm that {{recipientEmail}} is yours so {{appName}} can send your weekend plans. Open this link within {{expiresIn}}:

{{verificationLink}}

If you did not create an account, ignore this email.

{{appName}}

Hi {{recipientName}},

Someone asked to reset the password for {{recipientEmail}}. Open this link within {{expiresIn}} to choose a new password:

{{resetLink}}

If it was not you, ignore this email and your password stays the same.

{{appName}}
